        'tr.w1': 'The platform withholds 2.5% of what it pays you before VAT if you sell, 2.1% if you drive or deliver and 4% if you host, and pays it to the SAT toward your income tax.',
        'tr.w2': 'If the platform does not have your RFC, the income tax withholding rises to 20% of what you charge. On a 1,000-peso sale that is 200 pesos instead of 25.',
